r and video adapter and that is associated with a specific part of the user interface, such as a window title or a menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149094">system color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910011">ibara rya sisitemu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10109_123691_2529591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To hide parts of a file or clip without deleting them from the original source. Files and clips can be trimmed by adjusting the start or end trim point.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="123691">trim</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2529591">kunoza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10110_135005_1909902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The horizontal reference line on a grid, chart, or graph that has horizontal and vertical dimensions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="135005">x-axis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1909902">impembe x</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote