ation will no longer be able to access the file without opening it again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="33049">close</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504238">gufunga</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13372_413712_1910153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbol that is displayed beside a paragraph in outline view. You can use the symbol to display or hide subordinate levels of text and to reorganize text quickly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413712">outline symbol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910153">ikimenyetso cy'izitira</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13374_359204_505955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A complete Web site stored in a named subdirectory of the top-level Web site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359204">subsite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505955">urubuga ruri mu rundi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</term