ta access page. A disabled control cannot get the focus and will not respond to mouse clicks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140956">disabled control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504970">akagenzura kahagaritswe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1509_101960_504732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The likelihood of a computer system or device continuing to function over a given period of time and under specified conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="101960">reliability</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504732">ubwizerwe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15094_347947_505935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on a form that contains other controls in a table format and that repeats as needed. Users can insert multiple rows when filling out the form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="347947">repeating table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505935">imbonerahamwe yisubiramo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSp