lexia. These aids make on-screen information available as synthesized speech or a refreshable Braille display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652163">screen review utility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910258">porogaramu isuzuma mugaragaza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19196_652168_1910259"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field that is displayed in the series area of a chart and that contains series items. A series is a group of related data points.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652168">series field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910259">umwanya w'ibyiciro</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19203_652175_1910260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cell that has been linked to a non-repeating element in an XML map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652175">single-mapped cell</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910260">akazu kashyizwe konyine</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termN