ome network that can share pictures, music, videos, documents, and printers. A homegroup is created by using the HomeGroup feature; it is protected with a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777440">homegroup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1574332">itsindambanza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20698_782774_1771228"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A password that helps prevent unauthorized access to homegroup files and printers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782774">homegroup password</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1771228">ijambobanga rya homegroup</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20703_746420_1574296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action that removes redundant messages from an email conversation to reduce information overload and improve readability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="746420">Clean Up</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1574296">Isukura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfS