</termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27004_1362158_1597644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A webpage link saved as a .url file in someone's "Favorites" folder on Windows OneDrive. Favorites can be created directly within OneDrive, or via the Windows Live Toolbar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1362158">favorite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1597644">igitoneshwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27027_1362482_1910543"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mechanism for a MAPI client to initiate a quick shutdown of the client process, notifying all providers with which the client has an active MAPI session to save data and settings before the client process exits.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1362482">fast shutdown</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1910543">kuzimya ku buryo bwihuse</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27043_1364751_1910544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains the unique information for each data-merged document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1364751">recipient list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote ty