ite photo collage from multiple source photos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676496">Auto Collage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1787037">Ukwimatisha</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31335_1600004_1654372"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that verifies and eliminates lengthy chkdsk due to any transient errors that NTFS detects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1600004">Spot Verifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1654372">Ingenzuzi ya Spot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31336_1600005_1654814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of reducing the number of slabs allocated in thinly provisioned arrays and thinly provisioned virtual disks by rearranging data from sparsely populated slabs to densely populated slabs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1600005">slab consolidation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1654814">Gushimangira urukuta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpe