 numbers directly from websites in a browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814258">Skype Click to Call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2062456">Skype Click to Call</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3373_87656_504647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an entity, such as a user, a file or a computer that is currently connected a server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="87656">online</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504647">kuri Interineti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33730_1814259_2062459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tab in the Skype desktop client for displaying a user's Facebook newsfeed and Skype mood messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814259">Skype Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2062459">Ahabanza kuri Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote 