oxes, and then renders the malicious content harmless.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329598">ZAP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340122">Kwisiba burundu ku isaha igenwe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40092_2329599_2340119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of add-ins that transform pages from a variety of apps into sways.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329599">Send to Sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340119">Kohereza kuri Sway</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40093_2329763_2340117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The blog platform on Docs.com where users can share their posts using Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329763">Journal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340117">Ikinyamakuru</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40107_2330211_2340115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint authoring tool that allows users to create different types of SharePoint pages such as microsites, articles, and blogs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330211">authoring canvas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340115">kaneva y'ubwanditsi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40108_2330214_2340120"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The container that holds all the tools for the authoring canvas.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330214">toolbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340120">agasanduku k'ibikoresho</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40109_2330388_2340118"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to satisfy stringent SEC Rule 17a-4 record retention requirements with advanced administrative controls for archiving such as restricting changes to archiving policies and preventing such policies from being turned off or removed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2330388">Preservation Lock<