s from across all your task lists that meet the specific criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331937">smart list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342887">urutonde nyaryenge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40122_2331938_2342890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Mac OS X specific part of the app that allows Wunderlist to receive push notifications on the Mac.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331938">Wunderlist Helper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342890">Mufasha ya Wunderlist</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2342886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342886">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOf