ates or messages in Outlook for any Office 365 Connector that the user’s group is connected to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376842">connector card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2383355">ikarita ya muhuza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42023_2376843_2383354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that creates a custom connector once all relevant connector information has been filled in and saved.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376843">Connect to Office 365</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2383354">Kwihuza na Office 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42027_2377606_2383363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connector that is available to Office 365 users via Groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377606">Office 365 connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2383363">Muhuza ya Office 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender