sible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318135">computer administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505721">umuyobozi wa mudasobwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8657_9827_504080"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The person in charge of managing a computer. The administrator is responsible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="9827">administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504080">umuyobozi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8657_9827_505721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The person in charge of managing a computer. The administrator is responsible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="9827">administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505721">umuyobozi wa mudasobwa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="866_312761_505670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A System Audio Effects (SYSFX) component used to provide a more immersive audio experience in the Windows Media Player and thus an improved listening experience by utilizing the available speakers that a user has attached to his/her PC by sending audio to all of the speakers, regardless of the number of channels the content contains. This will provide a better sounding experience for stereo and quadraphonic content being rendered on multi-channel playback systems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="312761">speaker fill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505670">mutunganyamajwi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8664_55395_504428"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The stylistic attributes of a font — such as bold, italic, and underline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="55395">font style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="504428">imisusire y'imyandikire</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8688_228749_505240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of users, accounts, Web sites, etc. that are permitted to perform certain actions on a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228749">Allow list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505240">Ilisiti y'abemerewe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8688_228749_505528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of users, accounts, Web sites, etc. that are permitted to perform certain actions on a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228749">Allow list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505528">ilisiti y'abemerewe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8688_276556_505240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of users, accounts, Web sites, etc. that are permitted to perform certain actions on a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="276556">allow list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="rw-RW"><ntig><termGrp><term id="505240">Ilisiti y'abemerewe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">RWA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termN